    bestPractices: ["Create a context with a meaningful default or fail-fast hook.", "Keep the provider close enough to consumers to define a clear scope.", "Use Context for cross-cutting dependencies rather than rapidly changing local data.", "Split unrelated contexts when consumers need independent update boundaries.", "Document provider requirements and ownership."],
